AI didn't kill clicks. This slow death has been happening for over 10 years; AI is accelerating it. Today, 68% of all Google searches end without a click. 10 years ago? 45%.

I go into tons more detail — and what marketers can actually do about it — on the Marketing Against the Grain show. (Dream come true to be on this show!)

